    "New enemy. The Music Box. Listen carefully. After each attack you make, the melody plays and deals damage 3 times before your turn returns. Defending reduces melody damage by 50 percent. Press the button when ready to fight.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
