    "Your save data has been moved from localStorage to IndexedDB — a faster, unlimited storage engine. Characters, progress, achievements, and all settings migrated automatically. Nothing was lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seus dados salvos foram movidos do localStorage para o IndexedDB — um mecanismo de armazenamento mais rápido e ilimitado. Personagens, progresso, conquistas e todas as configurações migraram automaticamente. Nada foi perdido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your screen reader announcements work automatically — nothing to enable there. But a few opt-in features are easy to miss.": {
