    "⚔️ Set Bonus System — equip matching weapon and armor to unlock a set bonus. Shadow Set (+15% dodge, +3 ATK), Ember Set (+5 ATK, fire on every hit), Frost Set (+4 DEF, freeze chance), Forest Set (+3 ATK +3 DEF), Void Set (+10 ATK, life drain).": {
